        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion RH-E5, Blacksmith Trim Wall Mounted Robe Hook</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Blacksmith Robe Hook is great for keeping all sorts of things off of the floor not just in the bathroom. Hang a few by the front door as a catch-all for those everyday items like hats, coats, book-bags, and purses. You can even install a couple in your closet to keep things organized. The Blacksmith Trim Robe Hook is available in 4 finishes. It's traditional styling is great for modern homes because it is not ornate but still conveys a since of classic beauty. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/blacksmith-trim-towel-bar-fusion-tb-e2\"><b>Fusion TB-E2 Blacksmith Towel Bar</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/blacksmith-hand-towel-ring-fusion-tr-e2\"><b>Fusion TR-E2 Blacksmith Towel Ring</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/blacksmith-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-e2\"><b>Fusion PH-E2 Blacksmith Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Fusion Blacksmith Collection Robe Hook:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
